			"name": "Feline Friendship",
			"tooltip": "When Yuumi's Attacks and Abilities strike champions, she heals herself for <healing><health>@HealAmount@ health</health></healing>. If Yuumi <keywordMajor>Attaches</keywordMajor> to an ally within @HealDelayTime@ seconds, they are <heal>healed</heal> as well. This effect has a @PassiveCooldown@ second Cooldown.<br><br>While <keywordMajor>Attached</keywordMajor>, Yuumi gains <keywordMajor>Friendship</keywordMajor> with her ally whenever they kill a champion or minion. The ally with the most <keywordMajor>Friendship</keywordMajor> becomes her <keywordMajor>Best Friend</keywordMajor> and grants Yuumi bonus effects to her Abilities while she is <keywordMajor>Attached</keywordMajor> to them. <br><br><rules>The heal will automatically trigger if Yuumi is already Attached to an ally.</rules>"
